  "question": {
    "text": "A Carnot engine has efficiency&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>. Efficiency becomes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math> when the temperature of sink is decreased by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>. Temperature of the sink ( in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>&nbsp;) is&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "300",
  "solution": {
    "text": "The efficiency of the Carnot engine<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#951;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Work</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>output</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>Heat</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>input</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></mfrac></math><br /><br />or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#951;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></mfrac></math><br /><br />Also we can show that<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#951;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math><br /><br />where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub></math> is temperature of sink and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></math> is the temperature of hot reservoir.<br /><br />According to question<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></mfrac></math> ...(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></math>)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></mfrac></math> ...(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ii</mi></math>)<br /><br />From Eq. (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></math>)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub></math><br /><br />Substituting value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></math> in Eq. (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ii</mi></math>), we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>or</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>or</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>or</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>"
  }
